  "input_contract": {
   "input_kind": "surface",
   "min_thickness_ratio": 0.0,
   "rationale": "cfMesh ships BOTH a 3D workflow (cartesianMesh) and a native 2D workflow (cartesian2DMesh - meshes a profile ribbon one cell thick with empty front/back planes); it wraps a surface STL and tolerates non-watertight geometry. Raw thinness is handled by local refinement, so no hard thin-feature floor is set.",
