  "input_contract": {
   "input_kind": "solid",
   "min_thickness_ratio": 0.0,
   "rationale": "A coupled multi-region case is inherently 3D and needs a multi-solid CAD assembly (one closed solid per region) whose regions share conformal faces, so splitMeshRegions can cut them apart with matching interfaces. A single solid or a bare surface cannot express the coupling.",
